{"id":1505,"title":"Python 有多行注释吗？","summary":"Python 有多行注释吗？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3b23ef67-17cc-325c-a478-b8c0203829f0","knowledge_id":187,"title":"Python 有多行注释吗？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":187,"title":"Python 有多行注释吗？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b20ed088-4d06-3512-8478-6b00ebb19984","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中，使用 `#` 符号编写单行注释。\n\n但是，要写多行注释则可以使用多行字符串。\n\n在 Python 中，可以用三个（双）引号 (`\"\"\"`或`'''`)括住字符串来编写多行字符串。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中，使用 <code>#</code> 符号编写单行注释。</p>\n<p>但是，要写多行注释则可以使用多行字符串。</p>\n<p>在 Python 中，可以用三个（双）引号 (<code>&quot;&quot;&quot;</code>或<code>&#x27;&#x27;&#x27;</code>)括住字符串来编写多行字符串。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6697fe91-fea6-3fbb-936b-f24422a283ed","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 这是单行注释\n\n\"\"\"\n这是\n多行\n注释\n\"\"\"\n\n'''\n这也是\n多行\n注释\n'''","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"01c6911a-4952-39e1-81ab-02f7aeb7e199","title":"","title_html":"","text":"同样，我们也可以将注释字符串放在任何地方，而不用将其存储在任何变量中，这样它就像一个多行注释。\n\n下面是一个例子：","text_html":"<p>同样，我们也可以将注释字符串放在任何地方，而不用将其存储在任何变量中，这样它就像一个多行注释。</p>\n<p>下面是一个例子：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"093712da-1e38-3b47-9389-3616a4a3c223","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entr